        {
            "type": "table",
            "content": {
                "table_caption": [],
                "html": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th colspan=\"10\"><p>PT9L检验作业指导书（标准）</p></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"10\"><p>编号：QI-PT9L-EF04</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>Type</p></td>\n    <td><p>Page</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>Progress Name</p></td>\n    <td><p>Ver.No.</p></td>\n    <td><p>Date</p></td>\n    <td><p>Prepared</p></td>\n    <td><p>Checked</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>Approved</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>部件名称</p></td>\n    <td><p>页码</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>工序名称  </p></td>\n    <td><p>版本</p></td>\n    <td><p>生效期</p></td>\n    <td><p>准备</p></td>\n    <td><p>审核</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>批准</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>成品</p></td>\n    <td><p>1/1</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>测量模式切换</p></td>\n    <td><p>1</p></td>\n    <td><p>2024.06.20</p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>检验项目</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>检验用具</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"5\"><p>检验方法</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>合格标准</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\"><p>测量模式切换</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><p>2节7号电池</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><p>给主机上电\n\n测量状态下短按设置按键进入模式切换状态，\n短按设置键循环切换\n婴儿模式如图1，\n成人模式如图2\n物温模式如图3 </p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"3\"><p> <br><img src=\"images/a63a0b7014c18ef53bd57c175ca89f41ebd077a0fbb60d1d388729c479cd2096.jpg\"/></p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><p>测量模式可成功切换\n缺陷等级：MA</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
