            "content": {
                "table_caption": [],
                "html": "<table>\n  <tr>\n    <th colspan=\"10\"><p>PT9L检验作业指导书（标准）</p></th>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td colspan=\"10\"><p>编号：QI-PT9L-EF05</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>Type</p></td>\n    <td><p>Page</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>Progress Name</p></td>\n    <td><p>Ver.No.</p></td>\n    <td><p>Date</p></td>\n    <td><p>Prepared</p></td>\n    <td><p>Checked</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>Approved</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>部件名称</p></td>\n    <td><p>页码</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>工序名称  </p></td>\n    <td><p>版本</p></td>\n    <td><p>生效期</p></td>\n    <td><p>准备</p></td>\n    <td><p>审核</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>批准</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>成品</p></td>\n    <td><p>1/1</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>测量单位切换</p></td>\n    <td><p>1</p></td>\n    <td><p>2024.06.20</p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n    <td><p></p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><p>检验项目</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>检验用具</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"5\"><p>检验方法</p></td>\n    <td colspan=\"2\"><p>合格标准</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\"><p>测量单位切换</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><p>2节7号电池</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><p>给主机上电\n\n1.待机状态下长按测量键8秒，进入单位切换状态；\n\n2.短按测量键切换℃或℉单位，对应的单位符号闪烁，并伴有短蜂鸣一声；\n\n3.长按测量键2秒以确认所选单位，对应的单位符号将常亮2秒并伴有短蜂鸣一声。之后体温计将自动关机。</p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"3\"><p> <br><img src=\"images/336822610a7c0ea0edec1e0244f35f5701e281497a6be232024fbfdef53fd254.jpg\"/><br><img src=\"images/67e12078fcb69f13fe05cad86e4653292543c4e8514fbbcacb266a47685ab03b.jpg\"/></p></td>\n    <td rowspan=\"3\" colspan=\"2\"><p>单位可以成功切换\n缺陷等级：MA</p></td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n  </tr>\n</table>",
                "table_type": "complex_table",
                "table_nest_level": 1
            }
        },
